; invocation scripts (Drain $D1:8A96; Double Drain $D1:9446). Native opcode $38 heals
; the caster from the post-damage spell-slot amount, coupling sustain to damage/MDEF.
;
; Replace only its five-byte entry with a long-call helper and RTS. Expected pre-hook:
;   B9 14 00 AA 1A    LDA $0014,Y / TAX / INC A ...
; The helper advances the script pointer itself and returns carry set, matching the
; native command contract. Remaining old opcode-$38 body is unreachable and retained.
; JSL $F5:1100 ; RTS
; Origin: V108_DrainRecoveryOpcode38_Hook, baseline line 3951.
org $D19D0C
V108_DrainRecoveryOpcode38_Hook:
    db $22, $00, $11, $F5, $60

