; Bazooka-only charge guards for issue #2. M/X=16, native mode, DB=$7E.
; New allocation $F5:0900-$F5:09A0. Source-unwritten zero-filled expansion in accepted v1.34.
; No new WRAM, no tables/text/events moved, no P1/P2 ownership changes.
